<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s001> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "# Python 언어 특화 가이드"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s001/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2710, djr:R-2711 ;
    djr:text "\n\n> Python에서만 적용되는 관례, 패턴, 기법을 정리한 문서.\n> 클린코드 범용 원칙(네이밍, 함수 설계, SOLID 등)은 `discipline-cleancode` 스킬에서 다룬다.\n> Python 3.10+ 이후 도입된 기능을 적극 채택하며, 최신 패턴을 기본으로 제시한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s001/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.2 Optional과 None 처리 [단단한 파이썬]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2712 ;
    djr:text "\nNone은 모든 변수에 할당될 수 있어서 \"10억 달러짜리 실수\"라 불린다. Optional 타입으로 None의 존재를 명시하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 나쁜 예: None 반환 가능성이 시그니처에 안 보임\ndef find_user(user_id: int) -> User:\n    ...  # None을 반환할 수도 있음\n\n# 좋은 예: Optional로 None 가능성 명시\nfrom typing import Optional\n\ndef find_user(user_id: int) -> Optional[User]:\n    ...  # None 또는 User 반환\n\n# 호출 측에서 반드시 None 체크 필요\nuser = find_user(42)\nif user is not None:\n    user.activate()\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- `Optional[X]`는 `Union[X, None]`과 동등하다. Python 3.10+에서는 `X | None`을 사용할 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s004-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2713 ;
    djr:text "- mypy `--strict-optional` 옵션으로 None 처리를 강제하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s005-1.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.3 Union과 합 타입으로 상태 공간 제어 [단단한 파이썬]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s005-1.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s005-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2714 ;
    djr:text "\n곱 타입(Product Type)은 모든 필드 조합을 허용하여 유효하지 않은 상태가 생긴다. 합 타입(Sum Type)을 사용해 비정상 상태를 배제하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s005-1.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s005-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 나쁜 예: 곱 타입 - 유효하지 않은 조합 가능\n@dataclass\nclass Snack:\n    name: str\n    condiments: set[str]\n    error_code: int       # 성공 시에도 존재\n    dispensed_of: bool     # 성공 시에도 존재\n\n# 좋은 예: 합 타입 - 비정상 상태 배제\n@dataclass\nclass Snack:\n    name: str\n    condiments: set[str]\n\n@dataclass\nclass Error:\n    error_code: int\n    dispensed_of: bool\n\nresult: Snack | Error = Snack(\"Hotdog\", {\"mustard\"})  # 3.10+ 문법\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s007-1.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.5 TypedDict: 이종 딕셔너리 타입 지정 [단단한 파이썬]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s007-1.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s007-1.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2715 ;
    djr:text "\n외부 API, JSON 등 이종 데이터를 담는 딕셔너리에는 TypedDict를 사용하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s007-1.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s007-1.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 나쁜 예: 구조 알 수 없음\ndata = get_nutrition_from_api(name)\nprint(data['fat']['value'])  # 키가 뭐가 있는지 모름\n\n# 좋은 예: TypedDict로 구조 명시\nclass NutritionInfo(TypedDict):\n    value: int\n    unit: str\n\nclass RecipeNutrition(TypedDict):\n    calories: NutritionInfo\n    fat: NutritionInfo\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s013-1.11> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.11 Concatenate: 매개변수 추가/제거 [PEP 612]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.11" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s013-1.11/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s013-1.11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2716 ;
    djr:text "\n`Concatenate`는 데코레이터가 원래 함수에 매개변수를 추가하거나 제거할 때 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s013-1.11/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s013-1.11> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom typing import Callable, Concatenate, ParamSpec, TypeVar\n\nP = ParamSpec('P')\nR = TypeVar('R')\n\nclass Request:\n    user: str\n\n# 첫 번째 인자로 Request를 추가하는 데코레이터\ndef with_request(\n    func: Callable[P, R]\n) -> Callable[Concatenate[Request, P], R]:\n    def wrapper(request: Request, *args: P.args, **kwargs: P.kwargs) -> R:\n        print(f\"User: {request.user}\")\n        return func(*args, **kwargs)\n    return wrapper\n\n@with_request\ndef get_data(query: str) -> list[str]:\n    return [query]\n\n# get_data의 시그니처: (request: Request, query: str) -> list[str]\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s014-1.12> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.12 TypeIs vs TypeGuard: 타입 좁히기 [PEP 742, PEP 647]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.12" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s014-1.12/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s014-1.12> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n`TypeIs`(3.13+)는 `TypeGuard`(3.10+)의 개선판으로, if/else 양쪽 분기 모두에서 타입 좁히기가 가능하다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s014-1.12/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s014-1.12> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom typing import TypeGuard, TypeIs\n\n# TypeGuard (3.10+): if 분기에서만 좁히기 (else는 원래 타입 유지)\ndef is_str_list_guard(val: list[int | str]) -> TypeGuard[list[str]]:\n    return all(isinstance(x, str) for x in val)\n\n# TypeIs (3.13+): if/else 양쪽 모두 좁히기 — 권장\ndef is_str_list(val: list[int | str]) -> TypeIs[list[str]]:\n    return all(isinstance(x, str) for x in val)\n\ndef process(data: list[int | str]) -> None:\n    if is_str_list(data):\n        # TypeIs: data는 list[str]로 좁혀짐\n        print(data[0].upper())\n    else:\n        # TypeIs: data는 list[int]로 좁혀짐 (TypeGuard는 여기서 좁히지 못함)\n        print(data[0] + 1)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s014-1.12/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s014-1.12> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2717, djr:R-2718 ;
    djr:text "**권장**: 대부분의 경우 `TypeIs`를 사용하라. `TypeGuard`는 입력 타입과 출력 타입이 호환되지 않는 특수한 경우에만 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s025-3.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.3 __missing__으로 키별 디폴트 값 생성 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s025-3.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s025-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2719 ;
    djr:text "\ndefaultdict의 팩토리 함수는 인자를 받을 수 없다. 키에 따라 다른 디폴트 값이 필요하면 dict를 상속하고 `__missing__`을 구현하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s025-3.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s025-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass Pictures(dict):\n    def __missing__(self, key):\n        value = open_picture(key)\n        self[key] = value\n        return value\n\npictures = Pictures()\nhandle = pictures[path]  # 없으면 __missing__ 호출\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s032-4.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.4 None 반환 대신 예외 발생 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s032-4.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s032-4.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2720 ;
    djr:text "\n> dddjango 경계 단서: OHS 계약에서는 «부재·거절은 답»(#453·#454)이라 raise 가 아니라 결과 분기이고, 조회 use case 의 «없다»는 `None` 이다(그 밖의 use case 실패는 예외 — `<use_case>_result.py` 엔 성공 한 벌만, #571) — 이 절의 예외 우선은 그 밖의 일반 API 다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s032-4.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s032-4.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 나쁜 예: None 반환 - 0과 구분 불가\ndef careful_divide(a, b):\n    try:\n        return a / b\n    except ZeroDivisionError:\n        return None\n\n# 좋은 예: 예외 발생 + 타입 힌트\ndef careful_divide(a: float, b: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Raises: ValueError: b가 0일 때\"\"\"\n    try:\n        return a / b\n    except ZeroDivisionError:\n        raise ValueError('잘못된 입력')\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s035-5.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.1 functools.wraps 필수 사용 [파이썬코딩의기술] [슬기로운 파이썬 트릭]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s035-5.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s035-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2721 ;
    djr:text "\n데코레이터를 적용하면 원래 함수의 메타데이터(이름, 독스트링)가 사라진다. `@wraps`로 보존하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s035-5.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s035-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom functools import wraps\n\n# 나쁜 예: 메타데이터 손실\ndef trace(func):\n    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n        result = func(*args, **kwargs)\n        return result\n    return wrapper\n\n# 좋은 예: @wraps로 메타데이터 보존\ndef trace(func):\n    @wraps(func)\n    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n        result = func(*args, **kwargs)\n        return result\n    return wrapper\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s037-5.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.3 클래스 데코레이터: 메타클래스 대안 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s037-5.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s037-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2722 ;
    djr:text "\n합성 가능한 클래스 확장이 필요하면 메타클래스보다 클래스 데코레이터를 사용하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s037-5.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s037-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\ndef trace(kclass):\n    for key in dir(kclass):\n        value = getattr(kclass, key)\n        if isinstance(value, trace_types):\n            setattr(kclass, key, trace_func(value))\n    return kclass\n\n@trace\nclass TraceDict(dict):\n    ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s037-5.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s037-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s039-6.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.1 디스크립터 프로토콜 [파이썬코딩의기술] [파이썬 클린코드 2nd]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s039-6.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s039-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2723 ;
    djr:text "\n디스크립터는 `__get__`, `__set__`, `__delete__`, `__set_name__` 중 하나 이상을 구현한 클래스이다. `@property`의 일반화이며, 재사용 가능한 애트리뷰트 로직에 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.2 디스크립터 검증 프레임워크: ABC 기반 패턴 [Python 공식 Descriptor HowTo Guide]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2724 ;
    djr:text "\n> **의사결정 #5**: External 채택. Python 공식 Descriptor HowTo Guide 패턴을 기본으로 사용한다.\n> `instance.__dict__` 직접 저장이 더 단순하고 공식 가이드의 권장 패턴이다. `WeakKeyDictionary`는 `__set_name__` 이전 시대의 우회 방법이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom abc import ABC, abstractmethod\n\nclass Validator(ABC):\n    \"\"\"Descriptor HowTo Guide 스타일: 재사용 가능한 검증 디스크립터 기반 클래스\"\"\"\n    def __set_name__(self, owner, name):\n        self.private_name = '_' + name\n\n    def __get__(self, obj, objtype=None):\n        return getattr(obj, self.private_name)\n\n    def __set__(self, obj, value):\n        self.validate(value)\n        setattr(obj, self.private_name, value)\n\n    @abstractmethod\n    def validate(self, value): ...\n\nclass String(Validator):\n    def __init__(self, minsize=0, maxsize=None):\n        self.minsize = minsize\n        self.maxsize = maxsize\n\n    def validate(self, value):\n        if not isinstance(value, str):\n            raise TypeError(f\"str 타입이 필요합니다: {value!r}\")\n        if len(value) < self.minsize:\n            raise ValueError(f\"최소 {self.minsize}자 이상 필요합니다\")\n        if self.maxsize is not None and len(value) > self.maxsize:\n            raise ValueError(f\"최대 {self.maxsize}자까지 허용됩니다\")\n\nclass Number(Validator):\n    def __init__(self, minvalue=None, maxvalue=None):\n        self.minvalue = minvalue\n        self.maxvalue = maxvalue\n\n    def validate(self, value):\n        if not isinstance(value, (int, float)):\n            raise TypeError(f\"숫자 타입이 필요합니다: {value!r}\")\n        if self.minvalue is not None and value < self.minvalue:\n            raise ValueError(f\"최솟값 {self.minvalue} 이상이어야 합니다\")\n        if self.maxvalue is not None and value > self.maxvalue:\n            raise ValueError(f\"최댓값 {self.maxvalue} 이하여야 합니다\")\n\nclass OneOf(Validator):\n    def __init__(self, *options):\n        self.options = set(options)\n\n    def validate(self, value):\n        if value not in self.options:\n            raise ValueError(f\"{self.options} 중 하나여야 합니다: {value!r}\")\n\n# 선언적 사용\nclass Employee:\n    name = String(minsize=2, maxsize=30)\n    age = Number(minvalue=18, maxvalue=99)\n    department = OneOf(\"engineering\", \"design\", \"product\")\n\nemp = Employee()\nemp.name = \"Kim\"           # OK\nemp.age = 25               # OK\nemp.department = \"engineering\"  # OK\n# emp.name = \"\"            # ValueError\n# emp.age = 15             # ValueError\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2725 ;
    djr:text "> **레거시 참고**: 과거 `WeakKeyDictionary`를 사용한 디스크립터 패턴도 존재하지만, `__set_name__`(3.6+)이 도입된 이후로는 `instance.__dict__`에 직접 저장하는 공식 패턴이 권장된다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s040-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s042-7.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 7.1 세터/게터 대신 평범한 애트리뷰트 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "7.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s042-7.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s042-7.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2726 ;
    djr:text "\n파이썬에서 명시적 세터/게터는 파이썬답지 않다. 단순 공개 애트리뷰트로 시작하고, 나중에 로직이 필요하면 `@property`로 전환하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s042-7.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s042-7.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 나쁜 예: 자바 스타일 getter/setter\nclass OldStyle:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._voltage = 0\n    def get_voltage(self):\n        return self._voltage\n    def set_voltage(self, value):\n        self._voltage = value\n\n# 좋은 예: @property\nclass VoltageResistance:\n    def __init__(self, ohms):\n        self._voltage = 0\n        self.ohms = ohms\n\n    @property\n    def voltage(self):\n        return self._voltage\n\n    @voltage.setter\n    def voltage(self, voltage):\n        self._voltage = voltage\n        self.current = self._voltage / self.ohms\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s045-8.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.1 __call__로 호출 가능한 객체 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s045-8.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s045-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2727 ;
    djr:text "\n상태를 유지하는 훅이 필요하면 클로저 대신 `__call__`을 구현한 클래스를 사용하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s045-8.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s045-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass BetterCountMissing:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.added = 0\n\n    def __call__(self):\n        self.added += 1\n        return 0\n\ncounter = BetterCountMissing()\nresult = defaultdict(counter, current)  # 함수 자리에 사용 가능\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s046-8.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.2 @classmethod를 팩토리 메서드로 활용 [파이썬코딩의기술] [슬기로운 파이썬 트릭]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s046-8.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s046-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2728 ;
    djr:text "\n파이썬은 `__init__` 하나만 허용한다. 대체 생성자가 필요하면 `@classmethod`를 사용하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s046-8.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s046-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass Pizza:\n    def __init__(self, ingredients):\n        self.ingredients = ingredients\n\n    @classmethod\n    def margherita(cls):\n        return cls(['mozzarella', 'tomatoes'])\n\n    @classmethod\n    def prosciutto(cls):\n        return cls(['mozzarella', 'tomatoes', 'ham'])\n\npizza = Pizza.margherita()  # 대체 생성자\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s048-8.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.4 __repr__과 __str__ [슬기로운 파이썬 트릭] [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s048-8.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s048-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2729 ;
    djr:text "\n모든 클래스에 최소한 `__repr__`은 구현하라. `__str__`이 없으면 `__repr__`이 대신 사용된다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s048-8.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s048-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass Car:\n    def __init__(self, color, mileage):\n        self.color = color\n        self.mileage = mileage\n\n    def __repr__(self):\n        return f'{self.__class__.__name__}({self.color!r}, {self.mileage!r})'\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        return f'{self.color} 차 ({self.mileage}km)'\n\ncar = Car('red', 37281)\nprint(car)      # __str__: red 차 (37281km)\nprint(repr(car)) # __repr__: Car('red', 37281)\nprint([car])     # 컨테이너 내부는 항상 __repr__\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s049-8.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.5 비공개(__) 대신 보호(_) 애트리뷰트 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s049-8.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s049-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: 이중 밑줄 남용\nclass MyClass:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.__private = 42  # 네임 맹글링 발생: _MyClass__private\n\n# 좋은 예: 단일 밑줄 관례\nclass MyClass:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._protected = 42  # 관례적 보호 필드\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s049-8.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s049-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2730 ;
    djr:text "- `__var`: 네임 맹글링 발생. 하위 클래스 필드명 충돌 방지에만 사용하라.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s049-8.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s049-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- `_var`: 관례적 보호. 외부에서 사용 시 주의하라는 의미.\n- 파이썬 모토: \"우리는 모두 책임질 줄 아는 성인이다.\"\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s050-8.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.6 __init_subclass__로 하위 클래스 검증 (3.6+) [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s050-8.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s050-8.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2731 ;
    djr:text "\n메타클래스 대신 `__init_subclass__`를 사용하라. 더 단순하고 합성 가능하다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s050-8.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s050-8.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass BetterPolygon:\n    sides = None\n\n    def __init_subclass__(cls):\n        super().__init_subclass__()\n        if cls.sides < 3:\n            raise ValueError('다각형 변은 3개 이상이어야 합니다')\n\nclass Hexagon(BetterPolygon):\n    sides = 6   # OK\n\nclass Line(BetterPolygon):\n    sides = 2   # ValueError 발생 (클래스 정의 시점!)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s053-8.9> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.9 collections.abc로 커스텀 컨테이너 [파이썬코딩의기술] [단단한 파이썬]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.9" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s053-8.9/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s053-8.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2732 ;
    djr:text "\n커스텀 컨테이너를 만들 때 `collections.abc`를 상속하면 필수 메서드 누락을 방지한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s053-8.9/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s053-8.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom collections.abc import Sequence\n\nclass BadType(Sequence):\n    pass  # TypeError: __getitem__, __len__ 미구현\n\n# dict 오버라이딩은 dict 대신 UserDict 사용\nfrom collections import UserDict\nclass MyDict(UserDict):\n    def __getitem__(self, key):\n        ...  # 안전하게 오버라이딩 가능\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s053-8.9/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s053-8.9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.1 Enum/StrEnum: 상수 그룹화 [단단한 파이썬] [Python 공식 문서]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nfrom enum import Enum, StrEnum, auto\n\nclass Position(Enum):\n    CHEF = auto()\n    SOUS_CHEF = auto()\n    SERVER = auto()\n\n# 비교\nposition = Position.CHEF\nif position == Position.CHEF: ...\n\n# 문자열 Enum (Python 3.11+)\nclass Color(StrEnum):\n    RED = 'red'\n    BLUE = 'blue'\n\n# Python 3.10 이하 또는 target 제약이 있으면 str, Enum 조합 사용\nclass LegacyColor(str, Enum):\n    RED = 'red'\n    BLUE = 'blue'\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2733 ;
    djr:text "- 의미 있는 유한 상태는 임의 문자열보다 `Enum` 또는 `StrEnum`으로 표현한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2734 ;
    djr:text "- 직렬화 값이 문자열이어야 하고 프로젝트 target이 Python 3.11+이면 `StrEnum`을 우선 고려한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2735 ;
    djr:text "- Python target이나 의존성 제약 때문에 `StrEnum`을 사용할 수 없으면 `str, Enum` 조합을 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2736 ;
    djr:text "- 값 집합이 작고 지역적인 분기 표현이면 `Literal`도 가능하지만, 상태에 의미나 동작이 붙으면 `Enum`/`StrEnum`이 더 안정적이다(가능/불가의 판정은 아래 `Literal` vs `Enum` 분업 항이 소유한다 — 도메인 상태·종류는 Enum 이다).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b13>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-cleancode/references/final.md/s026-2.14/b3> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2737, djr:R-2738, djr:R-2739, djr:R-2740 ;
    djr:text "- 승격 판정(무엇을 Enum으로 만들지)·리터럴 허용 목록·소비 규율의 소유자는 `discipline-cleancode` §2.14다 — 요지: 닫힌 집합을 분기·판정에 쓰면 1곳째부터 집합 단위 타입으로(낱개 모듈 상수 나열 금지), 선언된 값의 비교·분기·대입은 심볼로만(`state == State.ACTIVE`). 비교는 `==`를 쓴다 — `is`는 문자열 Enum 값이 경계에서 plain str로 흐를 때 수화 누락 시 조용한 False를 만든다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2741, djr:R-2742, djr:R-2743 ;
    djr:text "- **파생 분류 집합**(terminal set 등)의 지식은 enum이 소유한다 — 1순위는 프로퍼티(`@property def is_terminal(self) -> bool: ...`), 여러 원소를 묶는 상수가 필요하면 enum과 같은 모듈의 `frozenset`(원소는 심볼). 소비처 모듈마다 임의 frozenset을 재정의하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s061-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2744, djr:R-2745, djr:R-2746 ;
    djr:text "- `Literal` vs `Enum` 분업(PEP 586): 위의 \"지역적 분기 표현이면 `Literal` 가능\"은 유지하되, 도메인 개념의 값 집합(상태·종류)은 Enum, 외부 API의 값 의존 계약(`open`의 mode처럼 인자 값에 따라 시그니처가 갈리는 자리)은 `Literal`로 가른다. `Literal`로 잠긴 인자 자리의 리터럴은 타입 체커가 검증하므로 허용이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s063-10.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.3 dataclass(slots=True): 메모리 최적화 (3.10+) [Python dataclasses 공식 문서]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s063-10.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s063-10.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2747 ;
    djr:text "\n> **의사결정 #7**: External 채택. `dataclass(slots=True)` 사용을 권장한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s063-10.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s063-10.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 나쁜 예: 기본 __dict__ 사용 (인스턴스당 ~200 bytes 오버헤드)\n@dataclass\nclass PointDict:\n    x: float\n    y: float\n\n# 좋은 예: slots로 메모리 절약 (20-50% 감소)\n@dataclass(slots=True)\nclass PointSlots:\n    x: float\n    y: float\n\n# 수백만 인스턴스 생성 시 차이가 크다\n# PointDict: ~170 bytes/instance vs PointSlots: ~96 bytes/instance\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s063-10.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s063-10.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "**주의**: `slots=True`는 새로운 클래스를 반환한다. 다중 상속 시 `__slots__`가 충돌하면 에러가 발생할 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.1 연산자 오버로딩 규칙 [Fluent Python 2nd]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nimport math\n\nclass Vector:\n    def __init__(self, x: float, y: float):\n        self.x = x\n        self.y = y\n\n    # 1. __add__: 좌항 덧셈. NotImplemented 반환으로 역연산에 위임\n    def __add__(self, other):\n        if isinstance(other, Vector):\n            return Vector(self.x + other.x, self.y + other.y)\n        return NotImplemented  # 절대 raise하지 말 것!\n\n    # 2. __radd__: 우항 덧셈. other + self 형태일 때 호출\n    def __radd__(self, other):\n        return self.__add__(other)\n\n    # 3. __iadd__: += 증강 할당\n    def __iadd__(self, other):\n        return self.__add__(other)\n\n    # 4. __mul__과 __rmul__: 스칼라 곱\n    def __mul__(self, scalar):\n        if isinstance(scalar, (int, float)):\n            return Vector(self.x * scalar, self.y * scalar)\n        return NotImplemented\n\n    def __rmul__(self, scalar):\n        return self.__mul__(scalar)\n\n    # 5. __matmul__ (@): 행렬 곱/내적 (PEP 465)\n    def __matmul__(self, other):\n        if isinstance(other, Vector):\n            return self.x * other.x + self.y * other.y\n        return NotImplemented\n\n    # 6. 비교 연산: __eq__는 대칭적, __lt__는 __gt__의 반영\n    def __eq__(self, other):\n        if isinstance(other, Vector):\n            return self.x == other.x and self.y == other.y\n        return NotImplemented\n\n    def __abs__(self):\n        return math.hypot(self.x, self.y)\n\n    def __bool__(self):\n        return bool(abs(self))\n\n    def __repr__(self):\n        return f\"Vector({self.x!r}, {self.y!r})\"\n\n# 사용 예\nv1 = Vector(2, 4)\nv2 = Vector(2, 1)\nprint(v1 + v2)      # Vector(4, 5)     -- __add__\nprint(3 * v1)        # Vector(6, 12)    -- __rmul__\nprint(v1 @ v2)       # 8                -- __matmul__ (내적)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "**핵심 규칙**:\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2748 ;
    djr:text "- `NotImplemented`를 반환하라 (raise가 아님). 파이썬이 역연산(`__radd__` 등)을 시도한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2749 ;
    djr:text "- `__eq__`를 정의하면 `__hash__`는 `None`이 되므로, 해시 가능 객체는 `__hash__`도 정의하라\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2750 ;
    djr:text "- `@` 연산자(PEP 465)는 `__matmul__`/`__rmatmul__`/`__imatmul__`로 구현한다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s070-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s071-12> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 12. pydantic v2 -- 런타임 검증의 새 표준"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s071-12/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s071-12> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2751 ;
    djr:text "\n> 출처: [pydantic v2 공식 문서](https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/), [Migration Guide](https://docs.pydantic.dev/latest/migration/)\n>\n> **의사결정 #1**: External 채택. pydantic v2 API를 사용한다. v1 API는 공식 지원 중단되었다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.0 pydantic v2 boundary 결정"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.0" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2752 ;
    djr:text "\npydantic v2는 외부 입력과 런타임 검증 경계에서 사용한다. API payload, 외부 JSON, config, settings-like data, message payload처럼 시스템 밖에서 들어오거나 시스템 밖으로 나가는 데이터의 shape와 coercion을 명시하는 데 적합하다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2753, djr:R-2754, djr:R-2755 ;
    djr:text "도메인 모델의 기본 표현을 pydantic으로 고정하지 않는다. durable domain invariant는 value object, entity, aggregate, domain service, application service처럼 해당 규칙을 소유한 경계에 둔다. pydantic validator는 boundary validation과 parsing을 담당하고, 상태 전이, 금액 계산, 권한 정책, 주문/결제 같은 도메인 규칙을 대신 소유하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2756 ;
    djr:text "- `BaseModel`은 외부 DTO, config, 런타임 boundary 검증에 우선 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2757 ;
    djr:text "- 내부 domain object가 dataclass, 일반 class, Django model, aggregate로 이미 표현되어 있으면 pydantic 모델을 중복 domain model로 만들지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2758, djr:R-2759 ;
    djr:text "- validation error는 adapter/API/config loading layer에서 domain/application error로 변환한다. raw pydantic error shape가 도메인 규칙의 일부가 되지 않게 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2760, djr:R-2761 ;
    djr:text "- coercion이 잘못된 입력을 숨기면 strict mode를 켠다. 단, 외부 계약상 문자열 숫자처럼 의도한 coercion을 받는 필드는 field-level로 허용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s072-12.0> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2762 ;
    djr:text "- Django Ninja Schema가 API serialization boundary를 이미 소유하면 별도 pydantic DTO를 추가하기 전에 `implementation-django-ninja` 기준과 충돌하지 않는지 확인한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s081-13.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.5 send, throw 사용 금지 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s081-13.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s081-13.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2763 ;
    djr:text "\n제너레이터의 `send()`와 `throw()`는 양방향 통신을 제공하지만 가독성이 매우 나쁘다. 대신 이터레이터를 입력으로 전달하거나 상태를 가진 클래스를 사용하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s089-15.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 15.2 최상위 예외 클래스 정의 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "15.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s089-15.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s089-15.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2764 ;
    djr:text "\nAPI 모듈에는 최상위 Exception을 정의하여 모든 모듈 예외가 이를 상속하게 하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s089-15.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s089-15.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# my_module/exceptions.py\nclass MyModuleError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"모듈의 최상위 예외\"\"\"\n\nclass InvalidInputError(MyModuleError): ...\nclass DatabaseError(MyModuleError): ...\n\n# 사용 측\ntry:\n    my_module.do_something()\nexcept my_module.MyModuleError:\n    ...  # 모듈의 모든 에러를 한번에 잡을 수 있음\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 15.3 @deprecated로 지원 중단 표시 (3.13+) [PEP 702]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "15.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2765 ;
    djr:text "\n> **의사결정 #4**: External 채택. Python 3.13+에서는 `@deprecated`를 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom warnings import deprecated\nfrom typing import overload\n\n# 클래스 지원 중단\n@deprecated(\"Use UserV2 instead\")\nclass UserV1:\n    pass\n\n# 함수 지원 중단\n@deprecated(\"Use fetch_data_v2() instead\")\ndef fetch_data(url: str) -> bytes:\n    return b\"\"\n\n# 오버로드 일부만 지원 중단\n@overload\n@deprecated(\"int 인자는 더 이상 지원하지 않습니다. str을 사용하세요.\")\ndef process(value: int) -> str: ...\n\n@overload\ndef process(value: str) -> str: ...\n\ndef process(value: int | str) -> str:\n    return str(value)\n\n# 사용 시:\nUserV1()       # 런타임: DeprecationWarning + 타입 체커 경고\nfetch_data(\"\")  # 런타임: DeprecationWarning + 타입 체커 경고\nprocess(42)     # 런타임: DeprecationWarning + 타입 체커 경고\nprocess(\"ok\")   # 경고 없음\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "**핵심**: `__deprecated__` 속성이 자동으로 추가되어 런타임에서도 지원 중단 메시지에 접근할 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2766 ;
    djr:text "> **레거시 참고**: 3.13 미만에서는 `warnings.warn(DeprecationWarning)`을 사용한다. 단, 이 방법은 런타임 경고만 발생하며 타입 체커와 연동되지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s090-15.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.1 GIL과 스레드 선택 기준 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n- **GIL**: CPython에서 한 번에 하나의 스레드만 바이트코드 실행.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2767 ;
    djr:text "- **스레드 사용**: 블로킹 I/O 시 (파일, 네트워크). GIL은 시스템 콜 전에 해제됨.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2768 ;
    djr:text "- **CPU 병렬화**: 기본적으로 `multiprocessing`이나 C 확장 사용. Free-threaded 빌드(3.13+)에서는 스레드도 가능.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s092-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 블로킹 I/O -> 스레드 OK\nfrom threading import Thread\nthreads = [Thread(target=slow_io_call) for _ in range(5)]\nfor t in threads: t.start()\n\n# 스레드 간 데이터 경합 -> Lock 필수\nfrom threading import Lock\nclass LockingCounter:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.lock = Lock()\n        self.count = 0\n    def increment(self, offset):\n        with self.lock:\n            self.count += offset\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s093-16.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.2 asyncio.TaskGroup: 구조적 동시성 (3.11+) [PEP 654]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s093-16.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s093-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2769 ;
    djr:text "\n> **의사결정 #3**: External 채택. Python 3.11+에서는 `asyncio.TaskGroup`을 기본 패턴으로 권장한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s093-16.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s093-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nimport asyncio\n\n# 나쁜 예: asyncio.gather에서 첫 번째 에러만 표면화\nasync def old_style():\n    results = await asyncio.gather(\n        fetch_user(),\n        fetch_orders(),\n        return_exceptions=True  # 예외가 결과에 섞임\n    )\n\n# 좋은 예: TaskGroup으로 구조적 동시성 (3.11+)\nasync def new_style():\n    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n        user_task = tg.create_task(fetch_user())\n        orders_task = tg.create_task(fetch_orders())\n    # 모든 태스크 완료 후 여기에 도달\n    # 예외 발생 시 ExceptionGroup으로 묶여서 전파\n    return user_task.result(), orders_task.result()\n\n# ExceptionGroup 처리: except* 구문\nasync def handle_errors():\n    try:\n        async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n            tg.create_task(might_fail_a())\n            tg.create_task(might_fail_b())\n    except* ValueError as eg:\n        # ValueError 서브그룹만 처리\n        for exc in eg.exceptions:\n            print(f\"값 에러: {exc}\")\n    except* OSError as eg:\n        # OSError 서브그룹만 처리\n        for exc in eg.exceptions:\n            print(f\"OS 에러: {exc}\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s093-16.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s093-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "> **레거시 참고**: 3.11 미만에서는 `asyncio.gather`가 유효하지만, `return_exceptions=True` 사용 시 예외가 결과에 섞이고 첫 번째 에러만 표면화되는 문제가 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.3 Free-Threaded Python (3.13+) [PEP 703]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2770 ;
    djr:text "\n> **의사결정 #2**: External 채택. Python 3.13+의 Free-threading을 반영한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "GIL을 비활성화하여 스레드 기반 진정한 병렬 실행을 가능하게 하는 실험적 기능이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\nimport sys\nimport threading\n\n# GIL 상태 확인\nprint(f\"GIL 활성화 여부: {sys._is_gil_enabled()}\")  # False면 free-threaded 모드\n\n# CPU 바운드 작업 -- 기존에는 스레드로 병렬화 불가했음\ndef cpu_intensive(n: int) -> int:\n    return sum(i * i for i in range(n))\n\n# Free-threaded 빌드에서는 실제 병렬 실행\nthreads = [\n    threading.Thread(target=cpu_intensive, args=(10_000_000,))\n    for _ in range(4)\n]\nfor t in threads:\n    t.start()\nfor t in threads:\n    t.join()\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s094-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "**현재 상태 (3.13)**:\n- 실험적 기능: `python3.13t` 별도 실행 파일 또는 `--disable-gil` 빌드 옵션 필요\n- 단일 스레드 성능이 다소 하락 (3.14에서 5-10%로 개선)\n- 런타임에서 `PYTHON_GIL=0` 환경 변수 또는 `-X gil=0` 옵션으로 제어\n- 모든 C 확장이 호환되는 것은 아님\n\n"@ko .

