    djr:text "\n인코딩/디코딩은 인터페이스의 가장 먼 경계에서 수행하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s109-19.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s109-19.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\ndef to_str(bytes_or_str):\n    if isinstance(bytes_or_str, bytes):\n        return bytes_or_str.decode('utf-8')\n    return bytes_or_str\n```\n\n" .

