<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s111-19.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 19.6 명명 규칙 [PEP 8] [슬기로운 파이썬 트릭]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
