    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s111-19.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s111-19.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2774 ;
    djr:text "\n| 대상 | 스타일 | 예시 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| 모듈 | snake_case | `my_module.py` |\n| 패키지 | lowercase | `mypackage` |\n| 클래스 | PascalCase | `MyClass` |\n| 예외 | PascalCase + Error 접미사 | `ValueError` |\n| 함수/메서드 | snake_case | `calculate_total()` |\n| 변수 | snake_case | `user_count` |\n| 상수 | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_RETRY_COUNT` |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s111-19.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s111-19.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "밑줄 관례:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s111-19.6/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s111-19.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2775 ;
    djr:text "| 패턴 | 의미 |\n|------|------|\n| `_var` | 관례적 보호(protected). 와일드카드 import에서 제외 |\n| `var_` | 파이썬 키워드와 이름 충돌 회피 (`class_`) |\n| `__var` | 네임 맹글링. 하위 클래스 충돌 방지 전용 |\n| `__var__` | 매직 메서드/던더. 파이썬 예약 |\n| `_` | 임시/무시 변수 (`for _ in range(10)`) |\n\n" .

