<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s126-25.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 25.1 repr 문자열 활용"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "25.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s126-25.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s126-25.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2783 ;
    djr:text "\n디버깅을 할 때 `print`를 사용한다면 `repr`을 호출해서 타입이 다른 경우에도 명확히 차이를 볼 수 있게 만들어야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s126-25.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s126-25.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nprint(repr(5))    # 5\nprint(repr('5'))  # '5'\n\n# 커스텀 클래스에 __repr__ 정의\nclass Money:\n    def __repr__(self):\n        return f\"Money({self.amount!r}, {self.currency!r})\"\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s129-26.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 26.1 독스트링 규칙 [파이썬코딩의기술]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "26.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s129-26.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-python/references/final.md/s129-26.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\ndef find_anagrams(word: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"주어진 단어의 모든 어구전철을 찾는다.\n\n    이 함수는 딕셔너리 파일의 전체 내용을 메모리에\n    로드하기 때문에 실행 속도가 느릴 수 있다.\n\n    Args:\n        word: 대상 단어. 빈 문자열이면 빈 리스트 반환.\n\n    Returns:\n        어구전철 리스트. 매치가 없으면 빈 리스트.\n    \"\"\"\n```\n\n" .

